      "message": "fix(ui): a relative model link resolves against the project folder\n\nThe link watch read a relative source path against the working\ndirectory of the process. The catalog case 3d/rough-finish links\nmodel/rough-finish.obj, so catalog_render (cwd crates/ui) said\n\"its linked file ... cannot be read\". The watch now joins a relative\nlink to the folder of the open project file. An absolute link, or a\nproject that is not saved, keeps the path as it is. A re-import of a\nlinked file keeps the link text as it was written.\n\nFixes #3686\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
